### 6.11c Attach receipt.jpg. Expect 201, mime "image/jpeg".
POST {{api}}/transactions/{{rentCash.response.body.$.transaction.id}}/attachments
Authorization: Bearer {{owner}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WinibexBoundary

--WinibexBoundary
