### ---- 6.17 Idempotency: a repeated request posts once ------------------------

### 6.17a No key. Expect 400, "This request needs an Idempotency-Key header."
POST {{api}}/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{owner}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "date": "{{today}}" }

### 6.17b A key that is not a UUID. Expect 400, "Idempotency-Key must be a UUID."
POST {{api}}/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{owner}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: abc

{ "date": "{{today}}" }

### 6.17c Create with a fixed key. Expect 201. Note transaction.id.
# @name idem
POST {{api}}/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{owner}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: 7a2e3d4c-5b6f-4a71-9b8c-0d1e2f3a4b5c

{
  "date": "{{today}}",
  "direction": "out",
  "method": "cash",
  "description": "Idempotency test, should exist once",
  "categoryId": {{cat6600}},
  "accountId": {{pettyId}},
  "gross": { "minor": 80000, "currency": "PKR" },
  "acknowledged_warnings": ["POSSIBLE_DUPLICATE", "REPEATED_DESCRIPTION"]
}

### 6.17d Send exactly the same again. Expect 201 with the SAME transaction.id.
POST {{api}}/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{owner}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: 7a2e3d4c-5b6f-4a71-9b8c-0d1e2f3a4b5c

{
  "date": "{{today}}",
  "direction": "out",
  "method": "cash",
  "description": "Idempotency test, should exist once",
  "categoryId": {{cat6600}},
  "accountId": {{pettyId}},
  "gross": { "minor": 80000, "currency": "PKR" },
  "acknowledged_warnings": ["POSSIBLE_DUPLICATE", "REPEATED_DESCRIPTION"]
}

### 6.17e Same key, different amount. Expect 409 IDEMPOTENCY_KEY_REUSED,
# "This was already sent once with different details, so it was not saved
# again. Start it again as a new entry." (F7: before the fix this answered 201
# with the first entry, as if nothing had changed.)
POST {{api}}/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{owner}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: 7a2e3d4c-5b6f-4a71-9b8c-0d1e2f3a4b5c

{
  "date": "{{today}}",
  "direction": "out",
  "method": "cash",
  "description": "Idempotency test, should exist once",
  "categoryId": {{cat6600}},
  "accountId": {{pettyId}},
  "gross": { "minor": 90000, "currency": "PKR" }
}

### 6.17f Post it. Expect 200, the 27th journal number.
POST {{api}}/transactions/{{idem.response.body.$.transaction.id}}/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{owner}}
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}

### 6.17g Only one exists. Expect total 1.
GET {{api}}/transactions?search=Idempotency%20test
Authorization: Bearer {{owner}}


